{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141310/extras/dce7fa0e377735ff155f2e7647ae87b0.avif?t=1765467053\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141310/extras_big/dce7fa0e377735ff155f2e7647ae87b0.avif?t=1765467053 width=800 height=52 /></span>The creature behind the desk insists that you play their wooden board game. And in this game, you are a captain looking for the mysterious realm known only as the abyss. To reach such a place, you\u2019ll need to conquer a continent, acquire an airship, and sail into cursed skies. Or rather, assemble a crew and have them do it for you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141310/extras/b6d40323adebb7ab674dc7b8d6478e05.poster.avif?t=1765467053\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141310/extras/b6d40323adebb7ab674dc7b8d6478e05.webm?t=1765467053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will take more than one attempt to defeat the game master and achieve victory, and every run will be different from the last. However, with strategy, tactics, and tenacity, you will be destined to reach your goal.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141310/extras/ee751569432324d84f80a1d688587de4.poster.avif?t=1765467053\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141310/extras/ee751569432324d84f80a1d688587de4.webm?t=1765467053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141310/extras/598c630c0ce1397f68e1a5d580810ce8.avif?t=1765467053\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141310/extras_big/598c630c0ce1397f68e1a5d580810ce8.avif?t=1765467053 width=800 height=52 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refine and upgrade a collection of distinct pieces and deploy them in a turn-based strategy board game. These pieces are your crew, and they will do as you say.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find new classes of pieces as you solve puzzles and explore the murky chambers beyond the desk. Please ignore the dark stains on the carpet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add new pieces to your collection in the middle of each run by recruiting fallen foes. Whether or not they joined voluntarily is irrelevant, since they will bleed for you all the same.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Role Reversal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3141310/ecee8e1a493545be9749d6188c559c08183acb7a.jpg"},{"name":"Dodge This","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3141310/0fb99c6f7c837692e9b5fc093d245739c6b8cde1.jpg"},{"name":"Dishonor Thy Foe","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3141310/934dce5b17e7dbf7d17a2059c908620b7d5bd3d5.jpg"},{"name":"Cosmological","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3141310/4f50ba53e25184566195b6022ed7b187ce379e47.jpg"},{"name":"Forbidden Dental Floss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3141310/e54efbdcc0cb267639ec71a4ae3ca8c486ee040b.jpg"},{"name":"Look at Me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3141310/f6c0fa08e2148a54f4fc58dd2b7a5dff8a288f5e.jpg"},{"name":"The Bloodline Dies Here","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3141310/8f960f1b1d622de902191b5acbe1545783ea4ca0.jpg"},{"name":"That Which is Deserved","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3141310/38f5271e83aa79800fd32b38963fdfcff9717197.jpg"},{"name":"No Stone Unturned","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3141310/3f62935b78a654d37dfb3ae1f9ea880cc3f22f33.jpg"},{"name":"Spread the Wealth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3141310/9122b12e7e7ff79da85ec91ebfa939e43922015a.jpg"}],"total":25},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3141310?t=1765467053","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141310/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765467053","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141310/99f870d047307a1c1abb236a34c00e8ab8720ef4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765467053","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141310/99f870d047307a1c1abb236a34c00e8ab8720ef4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765467053","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3